I left out the `aap:caps/http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. This node's declared capabilities are only `StateHandle<'seen', read>`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated to grant network access. Adding an outbound request that sends each item's text to an external host would widen what the node can reach, and I can't verify the approval from here. If the platform team updates the graph, the node's world and body can be revised to match.

